<title>UK: Cairn Energy eases as bid talk subsides.</title>
<headline>Cairn Energy eases as bid talk subsides.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cairn Energy Plc eased on Tuesday as ongoing talk of a possible bid subsided, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1114 GMT, the shares were off 8p at 558-1/2.</p>
</text>
